From dfe2936850aef00b6d526c91e5e2ae342888eee3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:44:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: type WebSocket handshake and frame diagnostics

Convert 12 existing handshake, TLS and codec failure/success producers to
reviewed typed metadata. Preserve the exact message, category/severity,
SPKI comparisons, TLS handling, response checks, errno and return paths.
Only public SPKI pin fingerprints are logged; no URL bearer token or key
material is added. Keep the native-V2 ignored-offer producer separate.

Add an actual unmasked-client-frame regression through WebSocketSock using
an owned socketpair. Assert ECONNRESET, empty output, and structured net/debug
error metadata. The other handshake branches are not newly forced here.

Scripted-diff commands (run at this commit parent):
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/websocket-handshake-diagnostics.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-network/websocket-handshake-source.json --apply
git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/net_websocket.cpp src/net_websocket_tls.cpp src/net_websocket_sock.cpp src/test/net_websocket_tests.cpp
python3 test/lint/lint-log-events.py src/net_websocket.cpp src/net_websocket_tls.cpp src/net_websocket_sock.cpp
git diff --check

The rule catalog and focused test are authored inputs. Exact AST conversion,
14 production event lint sites and whitespace pass. Native compilation and
the authored regression: NOT RUN. Newer canonical transport APIs require
reviewed rebase; never restore removed compatibility aliases or negotiation.
